/**
\page page_sttriggerdata2016 StTriggerData2016

\brief Concrete StTriggerData implementation for STAR Run 16 (year 2016) trigger data.

\section sec2016_overview Overview

StTriggerData2016 is the concrete implementation of the StTriggerData abstract interface for
<b>STAR Run 16 (year 2016)</b> raw trigger data.  It wraps a \c TriggerDataBlk2016 structure
(from \c StDaqLib/TRG/trgStructures2016.h) and exposes its content through the common
StTriggerData accessor API.

Compared to StTriggerData2013, Run 16 adds full TCU/RCC bunch-counter readout, BBC VP101 and
TAC-sum access, and MTD QT per-channel readout.  This run also supports the BES-II
fixed-target programme.

\section sec2016_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
StObject
  └── StTriggerData          (abstract interface)
        └── StTriggerData2016
\endcode

\section sec2016_runyear Run Year
Run 16, calendar year 2016 &mdash; Au+Au at &radic;s = 200 GeV; BES-II fixed-target.

\section sec2016_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mData  | TriggerDataBlk2016* | Pointer to the raw Run 16 trigger data block. |
| EvtDesc | EvtDescData2016* | Decoded event descriptor (transient). |
| L1_DSM  | L1_DSM_Data2016* | Decoded L1 DSM data (transient). |
| TrgSum  | TrgSumData2016* | Decoded trigger summary (transient). |
| mBC1[11]…mQT4[11] | various block pointers | Per-crossing crate sub-blocks (transient). |

\section sec2016_new New Compared to 2013

- tcuCounter() &mdash; TCU revolution counter.
- rccCounter(int crate) &mdash; RCC revolution counter per crate.
- bunchCounter() &mdash; full 64-bit bunch counter.
- bbcVP101(int ch, int prepost=0) &mdash; BBC VP101 board channel.
- bbcTacSum() &mdash; BBC TAC sum.
- mtdQtAtCh(int qtid, int address, int prepost) &mdash; MTD QT board per-channel value.

\section sec2016_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEvent* event = static_cast<StEvent*>(GetInputDS("StEvent"));
const StTriggerData* trgData = event->triggerData();
if (trgData) {
    unsigned long long bunch = trgData->bunchCounter();
    unsigned short vp101     = trgData->bbcVP101(0, 0);
    unsigned short mtdQT     = trgData->mtdQtAtCh(1, 0, 0);
}
\endcode

\see StTriggerData
\see StTriggerData2013
\see StTriggerData2017
*/
